{"id":"1e81058a944fcfbb","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness.md","title":"System T0的全层级可靠性","display":"thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness — System T0的全层级可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness"],"display":"thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness — System T0的全层级可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics]]","[[72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution]]","[[72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman","source_location":"V §4.1 print356/PDF368, full set-theoretic model of T; explicit proof for the existing T0 axioms and rules","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-model-correspondence-checked","proof_status":"all T0 axiom classes and three rule classes checked by finite derivation induction; not machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness — System T0的全层级可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0b8e7bc07374e97\" href=\"?note=c0b8e7bc07374e97\" title=\"72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics\">72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"33c5548cb56e0a61\" href=\"?note=33c5548cb56e0a61\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d8ac891559c0847\" href=\"?note=5d8ac891559c0847\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness\">72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; Chapter V by Jeremy Avigad and Solomon Feferman"},{"key":"source_location","html":"V §4.1 print356/PDF368, full set-theoretic model of T; explicit proof for the existing T0 axioms and rules"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-model-correspondence-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"all T0 axiom classes and three rule classes checked by finite derivation induction; not machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0,\\mathcal Q,\\mathsf E(\\mathcal Q),R_T\">\\(T_0,\\mathcal Q,\\mathsf E(\\mathcal Q),R_T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a> 的固定理论与实际规则；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_H,\\chi_\\eta\">\\(\\models_H,\\chi_\\eta\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c0b8e7bc07374e97\" href=\"?note=c0b8e7bc07374e97\" title=\"72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics\">72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"33c5548cb56e0a61\" href=\"?note=33c5548cb56e0a61\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5d8ac891559c0847\" href=\"?note=5d8ac891559c0847\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness\">72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness</a> 分别给避免捕获代入和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_T\">\\(=_T\\)</span> 的语义性质。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal Q\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal Q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline1:=\\mathsf S\\mathbf0\">\\(\\overline1:=\\mathsf S\\mathbf0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_0\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\models_H A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_0\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\models_H A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg(T_0\\vdash\\mathbf0=_0\\overline1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg(T_0\\vdash\\mathbf0=_0\\overline1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按实际有限推导归纳。命题重言式在任何原子赋值下真；等式自反及type0替换公理由项代入引理和相等的替换性真；后继不等于0及后继单射在ω中真；计算等式由归约可靠性真。MP保真来自Boolean蕴涵真值；带类型项代入保真来自项代入引理逐原子扩展到公式。归纳规则的两个前提对全部赋值真。固定除归纳变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 外的赋值，以自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 归纳得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:=k\">\\(n:=k\\)</span> 下真；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 用首前提，后继步用第二前提，公式代入性质将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\mathsf S n/n]\">\\(A[\\mathsf S n/n]\\)</span> 的值识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:=k+1\">\\(n:=k+1\\)</span>。最后取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=⟦ t⟧_\\eta\">\\(k=⟦ t⟧_\\eta\\)</span>，得到该规则任意实例的结论。默认赋值保证模型非空，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0=_0\\overline1\">\\(\\mathbf0=_0\\overline1\\)</span> 在它下值为0，所以该式不可证明。本条只给所列T0体系的语义可靠性，不据此断言形式化于T0内部的一致性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c0b8e7bc07374e97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"33c5548cb56e0a61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"5d8ac891559c0847","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,\\mathcal Q,\\mathsf E(\\mathcal Q),R_T$ 是 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 的固定理论与实际规则；$\\models_H,\\chi_\\eta$ 使用 [[72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c0b8e7bc07374e97","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_0,\\mathcal Q,\\mathsf E(\\mathcal Q),R_T$ 是 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]] 的固定理论与实际规则；$\\models_H,\\chi_\\eta$ 使用 [[72-df-system-t-quantifier-free-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"33c5548cb56e0a61","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution]] 与 [[72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness]] 分别给避免捕获代入和 $=_T$ 的语义性质。$A\\in\\mathcal Q$；$\\overline1:=\\mathsf S\\mathbf0$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"5d8ac891559c0847","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-t-semantic-substitution]] 与 [[72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness]] 分别给避免捕获代入和 $=_T$ 的语义性质。$A\\in\\mathcal Q$；$\\overline1:=\\mathsf S\\mathbf0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T_0,\\mathcal Q,\\mathsf E(\\mathcal Q),R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_H,\\chi_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"=_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline1:=\\mathsf S\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"T_0\\vdash A\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\models_H A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg(T_0\\vdash\\mathbf0=_0\\overline1).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"n:=k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"A[\\mathsf S n/n]","display":false},{"tex":"n:=k+1","display":false},{"tex":"k=⟦ t⟧_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0=_0\\overline1","display":false}],"bytes":2424,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness|thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness — System T0的全层级可靠性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness — System T0的全层级可靠性](72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness|thm-system-t-quantifier-free-soundness — System T0的全层级可靠性]]"},{"id":"b8200155e858da77","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"提取接口和证据限制来